{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/0e56723d66f24f131d53c4503bd9ba48.avif?t=1757893896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras_big/0e56723d66f24f131d53c4503bd9ba48.avif?t=1757893896 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TriggerLand</strong> is a chaotic third-person shooter that throws political correctness out the window and dives headfirst into parody mayhem. Step into a world where overblown stereotypes are your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through wave-based arenas filled with rednecks, conspiracy nuts, HOA, boomers, Karens, and more\u2014all brought to life with exaggerated voice lines. Every round gets harder, dumber, and funnier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/891f244ecc61a48a45c890bfa2db5710.avif?t=1757893896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras_big/891f244ecc61a48a45c890bfa2db5710.webp?t=1757893896 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Third-Person Action</strong> \u2013 Dive into a satirical wave-based survival shooter where nothing is taken too seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Round-Based Survival</strong> \u2013 Fight off escalating waves of enemies with unique wave pools that keep each run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Team Economy</strong> \u2013 Work together with a common pool of money earned from kills and round progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Terminals</strong> \u2013 Spend your team\u2019s earnings at buy stations to unlock and upgrade a wide arsenal of guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Map Variety</strong> \u2013 Battle across multiple themed maps ranging from absurd arenas to chaotic environments filled with humor and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Wield everything from classic rifles to quirky sidearms, each with distinct stats and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Jump in with friends for fast-paced co-op action where teamwork (and laughter) are the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/0d8ae5251c6a0b35cf888a198aebd50d.avif?t=1757893896\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras_big/0d8ae5251c6a0b35cf888a198aebd50d.webp?t=1757893896 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party-Game Energy</strong> \u2013 A shooter that doesn\u2019t take itself seriously\u2014designed for fun and messing around with buddies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819250?t=1757893896","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819250?t=1757893896","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/74e0254dfe400d4186ddf65803532c87da3bd454/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757893896","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/74e0254dfe400d4186ddf65803532c87da3bd454/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757893896","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"descri